    "progressSummary": "PLAN COMPLETE 2026-04-27: Detailed implementation plan in knowledge.md for PID generalization. Identified axiom-reduction opportunity (snf_exists provable via Submodule.smithNormalForm). Wrapper-file approach (A) recommended over direct-Mathlib approach (B) for closer alignment with the existing ℤ proof. No Lean code yet — next session implements.",
